  "bio": "InkArt Tattoo, located in the heart of Madrid, Spain, is renowned for their exceptional skill in the art of realism tattoos. Their work captures the essence of their subject matter with breathtaking accuracy and detail. Clients consistently praise InkArt Tattoo for maintaining an immaculate studio environment, ensuring both a clean space and a safe experience for every individual who walks through their doors.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Madrid, Community Of Madrid, Spain"
